From d2ea9ff440fe88e3b64435b7fed6d5540a9d9df5 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: itsdavidmandal <davidramovichmandal@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 8 Oct 2026 12:01:16 +0545
Subject: [PATCH] Add support for Acer Nitro AN515-45

The AN515-45 (AMD Nitro 5) was not matched by any DMI entry, so it got no
nitro_sense interface and no RGB support at all.

Tested on AN515-45, BIOS V1.08, kernel 7.0.0-34-generic:

- nitro_sense: fan_speed, battery_limiter, battery_calibration and
  usb_charging all work. Fan write verified via hwmon, CPU 1785 -> 4347 rpm
  and GPU 2000 -> 5172 rpm on "70,70", returning to auto on "0,0".
- hwmon exposes both fan RPMs and three temperatures.
- four_zoned_kb: genuine 4-zone RGB confirmed visually (multi-colour wave),
  hence .four_zone_kb = 1.

This model uses the legacy interface (.nitro_sense = 2) rather than v4.
Forcing nitro_v4=1 does give working fan read/write, but platform_profile
registration then fails with -EIO on all 10 retries and logs ten errors at
every load, so platform profile is excluded exactly as for the AN515-55.

Firmware limitations observed while testing, not addressed by this patch:

- four_zone_mode modes 0 (static), 1 (breath), 6 (meteor) and 7 (twinkling)
  do not light the keyboard. Modes 2, 3, 4 and 5 do; 4 and 5 honour the RGB
  argument while 2 and 3 generate their own colours. On modes 0 and 1 the
  firmware silently resets speed to 0, which appears to be its way of
  reporting an unimplemented mode.
- direction is discarded (reads back 0) for every mode except 3 and 4.
- per_zone_mode writes are accepted and read back correctly but never
  render. I also tested with the set_kb_status(0, 0, brightness, ...) call
  in set_per_zone_color() removed, and with an animated mode already
  running, in case mode 0 was switching the backlight off before the zone
  colours landed. The colours still never displayed, so this looks like a
  firmware limitation rather than a driver bug.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 src/linuwu_sense.c | 14 ++++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 14 insertions(+)

diff --git a/src/linuwu_sense.c b/src/linuwu_sense.c
index 025eacb..425ec28 100644
--- a/src/linuwu_sense.c
+++ b/src/linuwu_sense.c
@@ -511,6 +511,11 @@ enum acer_wmi_predator_v4_oc {
  static struct quirk_entry quirk_acer_nitro_legacy = {
      .nitro_sense = 2,
  };
+
+ static struct quirk_entry quirk_acer_nitro_an515_45 = {
+    .nitro_sense = 2,
+    .four_zone_kb = 1,
+ };
  
  static struct quirk_entry quirk_acer_nitro_an515_58 = {
     .nitro_v4 = 1,
@@ -652,6 +657,15 @@ enum acer_wmi_predator_v4_oc {
          },
          .driver_data = &quirk_acer_nitro,
      },
+     {
+         .callback = dmi_matched,
+         .ident = "Acer Nitro AN515-45",
+         .matches = {
+             DMI_MATCH(DMI_SYS_VENDOR, "Acer"),
+             DMI_MATCH(DMI_PRODUCT_NAME, "Nitro AN515-45"),
+         },
+         .driver_data = &quirk_acer_nitro_an515_45,
+     },
      {
          .callback = dmi_matched,
          .ident = "Acer Nitro AN515-55",
-- 
